<title>GERMANY: Israeli embassy in Bonn steps up security.</title>
<headline>Israeli embassy in Bonn steps up security.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Security precautions at the Israeli embassy in Germany were stepped up on Tuesday, a Bonn police spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The spokeswoman said police had information about a possible threat to embassy security but declined to go into detail or to specify what additional measures had been taken.</p>
</text>
